---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { href } from "../lib";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Leat Consulting is a London-based consultancy that helps engineering teams make software delivery secure without making it slow."
>
  <h1>About Leat Consulting</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    A London-based consultancy focused on one thing: making software delivery secure without making it
    slow.
  </p>

  <h2>Why this matters</h2>
  <p>
    A modern pipeline can read your source, hold your cloud credentials and ship to production without a
    person touching it. Attackers know this. Most teams have hardened their applications far more than the
    systems that build and deploy them.
  </p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul class="ticks">
    <li>We show our own work. Our workflows and the rules that protect them are public.</li>
    <li>We work through pull requests in your repositories, so your team sees and approves every change.</li>
    <li>We hand over. You own what we build, and your team can run it without us.</li>
    <li>We are plain about trade-offs, including when the simpler option is the right one.</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a class="button" href={href("contact/")}>Get in touch</a></p>
</Base>
